      </div>
      <div class="inspired-blend__copy">
        <div class="inspired-blend__eyebrow">Inspired by Nature</div>
        <h2 class="font-display mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] text-al-navy sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.25rem]">
          Inspired by<br />nature.
        </h2>
        <div class="inspired-blend__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/80 sm:text-[15px]">Inspired by our founder's enduring passion for horses and a simple belief that nature often holds the answers modern medicine overlooks, Animalife was founded to explore the extraordinary <span class="font-semibold text-al-orange">healing potential of botanicals</span>.</p>
        <div class="inspired-blend__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/80 sm:text-[15px]">By combining nature's most powerful ingredients with advanced nutritional science, we create innovative formulations that address the root causes of disease and dysfunction&mdash;empowering horses to perform with <span class="font-semibold text-al-navy">greater strength</span>, recover <span class="font-semibold text-al-navy">more naturally</span>, and enjoy <span class="font-semibold text-al-navy">longer, healthier lives</span>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

